ikely D, and prediction markets put von Wilpert's chances near 89 percent. Early local polls showed a close race, so the margin is trimmed slightly below the model baseline, but the fundamentals and consensus still point to a Likely Democratic pickup.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9032, "margin": 8.24}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.8828, "margin": 7.5}]}